<title>USA: CorVel increases share buyback.</title>
<headline>CorVel increases share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>CorVel Corp said Wednesday its board of directors had approved a 200,000 share expansion to its existing stock repurchase plan.</p>
<p>Since the fall of 1996, CorVel has repurchased about 339,000 common shares, equal to 7 percent of its outstanding stock. The expansion will increase to 550,000 shares the total number of shares approved for repurchase.</p>
<p>CorVel has 4,345,000 common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The purchased shares will be used for general corporate purposes, including issuance under the company's stock option and stock purchase plans.</p>
